						"key": "system.description.value",
						"type": "override",
						"value": "<p><em>You can expend a bardic inspiration die to blast nearby creatures with magical and extremely loud noise.</em></p> <p><strong>Action</strong> - 30 ft. Cone - Magical - 1 Round</p> <p>When you use this ability, you end the silenced condition on yourself, and dispel any magical zones of silence in the area that are eligible to be dispelled by <em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.oZwKW3I3yzrSdpLE]{Dispel Magic}</em> .</p> <p><strong>[[/save constitution]]{Constitution Save}</strong></p> <ul>     <li>         <p><strong>Failure:</strong> Target takes &reference[Thunder] damage equal to four rolls of your @UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.kg7VBahhFH6gDFIh]{bardic inspiration} die and target is &reference[deafened].</p>     </li>     <li>         <p><strong>Success:</strong> Half damage.</p>     </li> </ul>",
